              "id": "max_charge_power",
              "type": "number",
              "label": {
                "en": "Max charge power",
                "nl": "Max. laadvermogen"
              },
              "value": 800,
              "min": 100,
              "max": 2400,
              "units": {
                "en": "W",
                "nl": "W"
              },
              "hint": {
                "en": "Limits what this app commands, not what the battery can do, and does not apply in Self-consumption mode. The vendor app's separate \"On Grid Output\" setting caps what the inverter actually delivers and can only be raised there.",
